WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.776
Step 1. Open the immunization panel.

1.2
00:00:02.776 --> 00:00:08.600
The panel shows the patient's schedule of recommended doses and the doses that were

1.3
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:13.100
recorded. In the encounter, select the Immunizations tab.

2.1
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:15.542
Step 2. Read the panel header.

2.2
00:00:15.542 --> 00:00:20.438
It shows badges with the number of overdue and due recommendations,

2.3
00:00:20.438 --> 00:00:22.192
only when there are any.

2.4
00:00:22.192 --> 00:00:28.027
In an open encounter, it also shows Apply policy and Record immunization.

3.1
00:00:28.027 --> 00:00:30.326
Step 3. Read the schedule.

3.2
00:00:30.326 --> 00:00:35.372
Each row shows the vaccine, its forecast status badge, the dose,

3.3
00:00:35.372 --> 00:00:42.416
what it protects against, and its dates. Overdue, Due and Upcoming rows come first.

4.1
00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:45.451
Step 4. Read the administered doses.

4.2
00:00:45.451 --> 00:00:50.865
The Administered section lists the immunization records, newest first,

4.3
00:00:50.865 --> 00:00:56.393
each with a status badge, its date, and the dose, route and site.
